{"4458220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Little Beast in the Big Maze", "steam_appid": 4458220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fantastical, atmospheric Metroidvania platformer where you jump, fight, and expand your abilities to escape your exile and confront the beastly Queen who banished you. But will this fairy-tale end with you becoming a hero, or a beast?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of Louise, a castle servant exiled by the corrupted Queen--and find out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exiled to the Beneath</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and traverse the Beneath, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >treacherous caves and dark caverns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >forests of fungi and flowers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an ancient city long thought lost</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a sunken lake deep below the surface</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458220/extras/7b8c193b53a270b8d871047e8184f688.poster.avif?t=1783846106\" aria-label=\"Louise runs from a beast with a nasty mouth.\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458220/extras/7b8c193b53a270b8d871047e8184f688.webm?t=1783846106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458220/extras/7b8c193b53a270b8d871047e8184f688.mp4?t=1783846106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458220/extras/a7da3629b145ad22bda07b3ade10c4c5.poster.avif?t=1783846106\" aria-label=\"Louise jumps on bouncy leaves in the Redflower Forest.\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458220/extras/a7da3629b145ad22bda07b3ade10c4c5.webm?t=1783846106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458220/extras/a7da3629b145ad22bda07b3ade10c4c5.mp4?t=1783846106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Desperate to survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your grub-enhanced body, gain new fey abilities like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beast-Claw-Sword-Arms</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hair that lets you grab on to hanging mushrooms!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underwater Breathing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458220/extras/cd83737bc504ccb1406cf8f6bed91568.poster.avif?t=1783846106\" aria-label=\"Louise fights some arthro-dogs in the Caves.\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458220/extras/cd83737bc504ccb1406cf8f6bed91568.webm?t=1783846106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458220/extras/cd83737bc504ccb1406cf8f6bed91568.mp4?t=1783846106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458220/extras/1d0bc93e07a027482e350036ce0df566.poster.avif?t=1783846106\" aria-label=\"Louise hangs on some wall-mushrooms in the Fungi Forest and dodges a plant trap.\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458220/extras/1d0bc93e07a027482e350036ce0df566.webm?t=1783846106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458220/extras/1d0bc93e07a027482e350036ce0df566.mp4?t=1783846106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet charming characters and fearsome foes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vicious insect-dogs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creepy creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tiny but noble people!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458220/extras/7ead5282535ce5b15b800427f403d1d4.poster.avif?t=1783846106\" aria-label=\"Louise fights some tiny people in the Old City Annex.\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458220/extras/7ead5282535ce5b15b800427f403d1d4.webm?t=1783846106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458220/extras/7ead5282535ce5b15b800427f403d1d4.mp4?t=1783846106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend, among others:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishermen with a strange idea of a fishing spot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cohort of tiny but valiant fairies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tiny but noble people!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458220/extras/9ef36b7a1f81f7747f9fb793e7111ff9.poster.avif?t=1783846106\" aria-la